flowchart LR
    App[Explicit TCP test application] --> Local[127.0.0.1 SOCKS client]
    Local -->|VLESS / REALITY| Proxy[Separate proxy VPS]
    Proxy -->|Allowed peer and test port only| NB[Private NetBird path]
    NB --> Service[Owned lab health endpoint]
    Proxy -->|Public TCP destinations| WG[WireGuard / provider SOCKS]
    WG --> Egress[Mullvad internet egress]
    Proxy -->|Other private IPs / UDP / literal IPv6| Deny[Reject]
    Controller[Separate NetBird controller] -.-> NB
